{"version":1,"content":"<p>儘管CachyOS、Bazzite等新興遊戲發行版近來備受關注，Debian長期以來仍是許多Linux用户的首選系統。它以相對輕量、穩定可靠而著稱，Linux Mint等發行版也以Debian為基礎。不過，隨着Steam Deck和Steam Machine等設備推動Linux逐漸成為主流遊戲平台，Debian開發團隊似乎也開始把目光投向遊戲領域。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587224.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.214033+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:16:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"1385b5a711cc3317821aabbee049f4d47bfd98fe552aa8b790ce20facb51d926","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}